Html Tags
------------------

<h1> => create the main/big heading
<h2> => create the second level heading
<h3> => create the third level heading
<h4> => create the fourth level heading
<h5> => create the fifth level heading
<h6> => create the sixth level heading
<p> => create the the paragraphs

<b> => make the bold text
<i> => make the italic text
<u> => draw the underline below of the text
<strike> => cancel the text
<mark>=> highlight the text with yellow color

<sup> => used to move the text base line above
                  or
        any text is covert into power.

<sub> => used to move the text base line below
                  or
        any text is covert into base.

<pre> => used to display the information
    on a webpage as it is how you written
<code> =>The code element represents a fragment of computer code.
<var>=>The var element represents a variable.


